A Korean man in his early seventies with weathered tan skin, deep-set dark eyes, a short grey crew cut, a lean build and slightly stooped shoulders.
A faded olive work jacket over a cream knit vest and a white collared shirt, dark grey wool trousers, scuffed brown leather shoes.
A Korean girl of about ten with a round face, straight black hair in a low ponytail and a slim build.
A yellow raincoat over a navy school uniform, white knee socks and red rain boots.
Low dusk sun from the west, the persimmon-tree side, is the only key; the shelter's single fluorescent tube is off.
A worn brown leather doctor's bag with a brass clasp, about 40 cm wide, hanging heavy from its handles.
